direction: right
title: Databricks Classic Architecture: Control vs Data Plane

ControlPlane: Databricks Control Plane {
  style.stroke: "#38BDF8"
  UI: Web UI & Notebooks
  Workflow: Workflows & Cluster Manager
  UC: Unity Catalog Service
}

Tunnel: Secure Transit (Relay / PrivateLink) {
  style.stroke: "#FBBF24"
  Desc: No Public IPs, Outbound 443 Only
}

DataPlane: Customer Cloud Account {
  style.stroke: "#34D399"
  Driver: Driver VM Node
  Workers: Worker VMs (Photon Execution)
  Storage: Cloud Object Storage (S3 / ADLS Gen2)

  Driver <-> Workers: Tasks
  Workers <-> Storage: Direct Parquet & Delta Read/Write
}

ControlPlane.Workflow -> Tunnel: Instructions { style.stroke: "#FBBF24" }
Tunnel -> DataPlane.Driver: Cluster Management { style.stroke: "#34D399" }
